01:07.867 --> 01:10.407
<b>[both whimpering]</b>

01:11.207 --> 01:13.707
<b>[chomping]</b>

01:17.757 --> 01:19.127
<b>[grunts]</b>

01:19.627 --> 01:22.717
<b>[roaring]</b>

01:22.837 --> 01:24.137
<b>[all gasp]</b>

01:24.257 --> 01:25.217
<b>Could it be?</b>

01:25.337 --> 01:26.347
<b>It may have healed,</b>

01:26.677 --> 01:28.807
<b>but at least now all those
damnable Wights are gone.</b>

01:28.927 --> 01:29.887
<b>[grunts]</b>

01:30.387 --> 01:31.807
<b>Gowtan, stop!</b>

01:32.137 --> 01:33.437
<b>Get away from that thing!</b>

01:33.557 --> 01:36.227
<b>[Gowtan grunts] I'll settle this
once and for all!</b>

01:36.357 --> 01:37.857
<b>[roars]</b>

01:37.977 --> 01:39.567
<b>[all straining]</b>

01:39.687 --> 01:41.237
<b>[both whimpering]</b>

01:41.357 --> 01:42.357
<b>[gasps]</b>

01:42.987 --> 01:47.527
<b>[roaring]</b>

01:48.287 --> 01:50.327
<b>[grunting]</b>

01:56.417 --> 01:59.587
<b>[roars]</b>

01:59.707 --> 02:01.547
<b>[all whimpering]</b>

02:01.667 --> 02:03.587
<b>[both whimpering]</b>

02:03.717 --> 02:05.337
<b>[growls]</b>

02:05.467 --> 02:08.177
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE] Ghoul Head
has evolved into Mad Headder.</b>

02:08.297 --> 02:10.427
<b>Level 40 has been reached.</b>

02:11.097 --> 02:12.977
<b>[ELYMAS] I can't believe it.</b>

02:13.097 --> 02:15.557
<b>The Ghoul Head's already risen
to Gowtan's level?</b>

02:15.687 --> 02:19.067
<b>[laughing]</b>

02:21.397 --> 02:23.357
<b>Uh, what just happened?</b>

02:23.487 --> 02:25.527
<b>[grunts] This is bad.</b>

02:26.857 --> 02:29.907
<b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b>

03:40.267 --> 03:45.737
<b>BEGIN ADVENTURE</b>

03:56.947 --> 04:00.827
<b>EPISODE 4 EXISTENCE EVOLUTION</b>

04:00.957 --> 04:01.917
<b>[Mad Headder growling]</b>

04:02.037 --> 04:03.207
<b>[all whimpering]</b>

04:03.337 --> 04:04.757
<b>[both whimpering]</b>

04:04.877 --> 04:06.837
<b>[gasps]</b>

04:06.967 --> 04:10.297
<b>[breathing heavily]</b>

04:10.427 --> 04:12.137
<b>[ELYMAS] Existence Evolution.</b>

04:12.257 --> 04:15.387
<b>A rare event that occurs
when certain conditions are met.</b>

04:16.177 --> 04:17.267
<b>TAKE THIS!</b>

04:17.727 --> 04:19.887
<b>It primarily refers to monsters
awakening latent abilities</b>

04:20.017 --> 04:22.607
<b>and transforming
into another species altogether</b>

04:22.727 --> 04:24.357
<b>to escape sticky situations.</b>

04:24.477 --> 04:26.187
<b>BUFF - WHAT? - NO WAY!</b>

04:26.777 --> 04:29.237
<b>Even in Magic World,
the exact conditions</b>

04:29.357 --> 04:32.067
<b>for Existence Evolution
weren't very clear.</b>

04:32.817 --> 04:34.697
<b>But I know this much.</b>

04:34.827 --> 04:37.407
<b>Things have taken a huge turn
for the worse.</b>

04:38.037 --> 04:38.997
<b>[gasps]</b>

04:39.117 --> 04:41.877
<b>Gowtan! Don't stand there!</b>

04:41.997 --> 04:43.207
<b>[grunts]</b>

04:43.327 --> 04:44.377
<b>[groans]</b>

04:44.497 --> 04:45.997
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Status Effect. Stunned.</b>

04:46.127 --> 04:47.627
<b>-Teal! Paul!
-[both gasp]</b>

04:47.757 --> 04:48.797
<b>Go distract the big guy!</b>

04:48.917 --> 04:51.217
<b>What is it you expect us to do?</b>

04:51.337 --> 04:52.677
<b>If I attack using magic,</b>

04:52.797 --> 04:55.257
<b>that thing will kill me so fast,
I won't know what happened!</b>

04:55.387 --> 04:57.387
<b>[grunts]
But if Gowtan goes down,</b>

04:57.507 --> 04:58.977
<b>every last one of us will die!</b>

04:59.097 --> 05:01.137
<b>-We can't let that happen!
-[roars]</b>

05:01.267 --> 05:02.267
<b>[grunts]</b>

05:02.977 --> 05:04.227
<b>[groans]</b>

05:04.357 --> 05:05.437
<b>[grunts]</b>

05:05.567 --> 05:06.607
<b>[Gowtan yells]</b>

05:06.727 --> 05:08.187
<b>[gasps]</b>

05:08.317 --> 05:09.607
<b>[both whimpering]</b>

05:10.737 --> 05:11.777
<b>[grunts]</b>

05:13.867 --> 05:15.067
<b>[groaning]</b>

05:15.197 --> 05:17.787
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Status Effect. Paralysis.</b>

05:17.907 --> 05:19.327
<b>[both gasp]</b>

05:19.447 --> 05:23.917
<b>-[groaning]
-[Mad Headder growls]</b>

05:25.457 --> 05:26.877
<b>[roars]</b>

05:26.997 --> 05:28.667
<b>-[both whimpering]
-[grunts]</b>

05:28.797 --> 05:31.877
<b>[both grunt]</b>

05:35.847 --> 05:37.677
<b>[breathes deeply]</b>

05:37.807 --> 05:38.967
<b>[both whimper]</b>

05:39.097 --> 05:40.717
<b>-[ELYMAS] I'll distract it!
-[both gasp]</b>

05:40.847 --> 05:42.847
<b>Meanwhile, you get Gowtan,</b>

05:42.977 --> 05:44.977
<b>then cast
Heal and Paralysis Heal on him.</b>

05:45.107 --> 05:46.437
<b>You hear me, Teal?!</b>

05:46.557 --> 05:49.317
<b>I haven't upgraded
to Paralysis Heal.</b>

05:49.437 --> 05:52.317
<b>I used up all my skill points
to increase my attack!</b>

05:52.447 --> 05:54.357
<b>So I can't cure him!</b>

05:54.487 --> 05:55.657
<b>[ELYMAS] Is he serious?</b>

05:55.777 --> 05:57.567
<b>[grunts] What kind of
half-assed build is that?</b>

05:57.697 --> 05:59.737
<b>[ELYMAS] Either way,
you should take Gowtan</b>

05:59.867 --> 06:01.657
<b>to a safe place
and heal his wounds!</b>

06:01.787 --> 06:03.867
<b>-Now move!
-Right!</b>

06:04.407 --> 06:05.957
<b>-[panting]
-[grunts]</b>

06:08.917 --> 06:10.457
<b>[ELYMAS]
When they're hit directly,</b>

06:10.587 --> 06:12.627
<b>most people recover
from Mad Headder's poison</b>

06:12.757 --> 06:14.337
<b>after three minutes on average.</b>

06:16.007 --> 06:17.797
<b>If I can survive that long...</b>

06:17.927 --> 06:18.927
<b>[panting heavily]</b>

06:20.847 --> 06:23.687
<b>...Teal will have Gowtan back
in the fight with us.</b>

06:23.807 --> 06:24.767
<b>[TEAL] Heal.</b>

06:25.387 --> 06:26.977
<b>[ELYMAS] One thing's for sure,</b>

06:27.397 --> 06:28.817
<b>I didn't know that reality</b>

06:29.727 --> 06:31.857
<b>would be so different
from the game.</b>

06:31.987 --> 06:34.197
<b>MONSTER: MAD HEADDER</b>

06:34.317 --> 06:36.157
<b>[gasps]</b>

06:36.277 --> 06:39.117
<b>[grunts] I'll fight you,
Mad Headder,</b>

06:39.657 --> 06:41.157
<b>until Gowtan rallies.</b>

06:41.287 --> 06:43.037
<b>So let's do this!</b>

06:43.157 --> 06:45.657
<b>[growls]</b>

06:45.787 --> 06:46.787
<b>-[all whimpering]
-[ADVENTURER 1] What?</b>

06:47.327 --> 06:49.667
<b>An F-rank adventurer can't go up
against a monster like that.</b>

06:49.787 --> 06:51.667
<b>-He'll be torn apart!
-You fool!</b>

06:51.797 --> 06:53.917
<b>We should run
while we still can!</b>

06:54.047 --> 06:56.587
<b>Once that thing kills him,
we'll be next!</b>

06:57.587 --> 06:59.467
<b>-Hey, slow down. Wait for me!
-[all gasp]</b>

06:59.587 --> 07:00.847
<b>[ELYMAS] That's fine.</b>

07:01.137 --> 07:04.177
<b>If they joined the fray,
they wouldn't last 10 seconds.</b>

07:04.307 --> 07:06.727
<b>I can't afford to defend
low-level adventurers</b>

07:06.847 --> 07:08.147
<b>while I'm trying
to fight this thing</b>

07:08.267 --> 07:09.267
<b>-single-handedly.
-[whimpers]</b>

07:09.397 --> 07:12.357
<b>-[Gowtan groaning]
-[Teal whimpering]</b>

07:13.817 --> 07:17.317
<b>[roaring]</b>

07:17.447 --> 07:18.697
<b>[gasps]</b>

07:18.817 --> 07:21.867
<b>[roaring]</b>

07:24.947 --> 07:26.497
<b>[ELYMAS] I'm Level 16 now.</b>

07:26.867 --> 07:29.577
<b>But the Mad Headder
is already up to Level 40.</b>

07:30.917 --> 07:33.417
<b>Even one mistake,
and I'll be dead!</b>

07:33.547 --> 07:36.167
<b>[Mad Headder grunting]</b>

07:37.927 --> 07:39.177
<b>[electricity crackling]</b>

07:39.297 --> 07:41.967
<b>-[roars]
-[gasps]</b>

07:42.097 --> 07:43.007
<b>[grunts]</b>

07:44.307 --> 07:45.347
<b>[grunts]</b>

07:46.637 --> 07:48.597
<b>[growls]</b>

07:48.977 --> 07:51.357
<b>[Elymas panting]</b>

07:53.727 --> 07:56.487
<b>[panting]</b>

07:59.857 --> 08:01.867
<b>[growls]</b>

08:10.747 --> 08:11.747
<b>[panting]</b>

08:11.877 --> 08:13.167
<b>[growls]</b>

08:20.387 --> 08:21.547
<b>[stone clattering]</b>

08:21.677 --> 08:23.177
<b>[growls]</b>

08:23.307 --> 08:24.467
<b>[grunts]</b>

08:25.137 --> 08:27.177
<b>[♪ intense music playing]</b>

08:33.227 --> 08:34.437
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:34.857 --> 08:36.187
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:36.317 --> 08:38.317
<b>[growls]</b>

08:38.687 --> 08:39.647
<b>[Elymas grunts]</b>

08:39.777 --> 08:41.777
<b>[roars]</b>

08:41.907 --> 08:43.277
<b>[Mad Headder grunts]</b>

08:43.407 --> 08:45.447
<b>[Elymas yelling]</b>

08:45.947 --> 08:48.617
<b>[grunting]</b>

08:50.287 --> 08:51.877
<b>[all gasp]</b>

08:52.207 --> 08:54.627
<b>[ELYMAS] Our level difference
is too great.</b>

08:55.247 --> 08:56.417
<b>This blows.</b>

08:56.707 --> 08:58.127
<b>I never thought
I'd be facing down</b>

08:58.257 --> 09:00.627
<b>such a powerful opponent
unprepared.</b>

09:01.927 --> 09:04.427
<b>I wanted to avoid a situation
like this.</b>

09:05.097 --> 09:07.467
<b>It's high-risk, high-return.</b>

09:07.807 --> 09:09.767
<b>I feel like the limits
of my abilities</b>

09:09.887 --> 09:11.387
<b>are being put to the test.</b>

09:12.517 --> 09:14.727
<b>It's definitely got
my blood pumping!</b>

09:16.727 --> 09:18.067
<b>[grunts]</b>

09:18.187 --> 09:19.897
<b>[panting]</b>

09:22.857 --> 09:24.487
<b>-[Elymas grunts]
-[gasps]</b>

09:24.617 --> 09:25.697
<b>Oh, wow.</b>

09:25.827 --> 09:27.617
<b>Is this Heavy Knight
actually holding his own</b>

09:27.737 --> 09:30.537
<b>against the same monster
that sent Mr. Gowtan flying off</b>

09:30.657 --> 09:34.037
<b>-head-over-heels?
-Idiot. He's slowly losing.</b>

09:34.417 --> 09:35.577
<b>It's a miracle</b>

09:35.707 --> 09:36.917
<b>-he's not dead yet.
-[grunts]</b>

09:38.757 --> 09:40.757
<b>-[roars]
-[grunts]</b>

09:41.587 --> 09:43.047
<b>[Mad Headder growls]</b>

09:46.177 --> 09:47.347
<b>[ELYMAS] If I just keep allowing</b>

09:47.467 --> 09:49.217
<b>the Mad Headder
to attack me like that,</b>

09:49.637 --> 09:51.557
<b>it's going to land
a blow eventually.</b>

09:52.307 --> 09:53.307
<b>I've got to think.</b>

09:53.887 --> 09:55.897
<b>There must be something else
I can do.</b>

09:56.017 --> 09:57.267
<b>REMAINING SKILL POINTS: 5</b>

09:57.767 --> 09:59.227
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Beginner Swordsmanship</b>

09:59.357 --> 10:00.857
<b>has reached Level Five.</b>

10:00.987 --> 10:03.357
<b>Vital Slice Skill
has been acquired.</b>

10:03.487 --> 10:05.567
<b>Skill, Vital Slice.</b>

10:05.697 --> 10:08.777
<b>Land a heavy blow with a blade
from zero distance.</b>

10:08.907 --> 10:12.037
<b>Effective against targets
with high defense.</b>

10:14.367 --> 10:15.537
<b>Right!</b>

10:18.667 --> 10:21.337
<b>[roars]</b>

10:21.457 --> 10:23.757
<b>[ELYMAS] Parry! [grunts]</b>

10:23.877 --> 10:26.217
<b>[grunting]</b>

10:34.177 --> 10:35.267
<b>[grunts]</b>

10:35.387 --> 10:36.897
<b>Vital Slice!</b>

10:37.607 --> 10:39.437
<b>-[grunts]
-[both gasp]</b>

10:39.567 --> 10:40.767
<b>[grunts]</b>

10:40.897 --> 10:41.937
<b>[sighs]</b>

10:43.107 --> 10:45.027
<b>[Mad Headder growls]</b>

10:46.407 --> 10:47.447
<b>[sighs]</b>

10:48.867 --> 10:50.867
<b>[growls]</b>

10:50.987 --> 10:52.497
<b>[both whimpering]</b>

10:52.617 --> 10:53.577
<b>[sighs]</b>

10:55.247 --> 10:57.537
<b>[ELYMAS] Vital Slice sacrifices
the blade's reach.</b>

10:57.667 --> 11:00.207
<b>-So it was considered subpar.
-[growls]</b>

11:00.337 --> 11:01.747
<b>-[all whimpering]
- But its effectiveness</b>

11:01.877 --> 11:04.297
<b>at dealing damage
works perfectly for low-attack,</b>

11:04.417 --> 11:06.177
<b>high-defense builds.</b>

11:06.297 --> 11:07.587
<b>Like for Heavy Knights.</b>

11:08.217 --> 11:11.717
<b>However, that alone
won't be enough to defeat it.</b>

11:11.847 --> 11:14.677
<b>[roars]</b>

11:14.807 --> 11:17.187
<b>[both grunting]</b>

11:20.897 --> 11:22.437
<b>It's attacking wildly!</b>

11:22.977 --> 11:25.857
<b>[roaring]</b>

11:25.987 --> 11:27.487
<b>Don't you worry, Mad Headder,</b>

11:27.607 --> 11:29.907
<b>because now the real battle's
about to begin!</b>

11:30.907 --> 11:32.327
<b>-But...
-[growls]</b>

11:32.867 --> 11:34.697
<b>...I'm afraid my job is done.</b>

11:36.327 --> 11:38.917
<b>-[growls]
-[Gowtan yells]</b>

11:39.577 --> 11:40.787
<b>[all gasp]</b>

11:41.587 --> 11:42.627
<b>[chuckles smugly]</b>

11:43.957 --> 11:46.917
<b>[roars]</b>

11:47.047 --> 11:49.007
<b>[both grunt]</b>

11:53.097 --> 11:54.637
<b>It's attacking wildly!</b>

11:55.097 --> 11:58.057
<b>[roaring]</b>

11:58.187 --> 11:59.687
<b>Don't you worry, Mad Headder,</b>

11:59.807 --> 12:02.107
<b>because now the real battle's
about to begin.</b>

12:03.107 --> 12:04.527
<b>-But...
-[growls]</b>

12:05.067 --> 12:07.067
<b>...I'm afraid my job is done.</b>

12:07.897 --> 12:10.947
<b>-[growls]
-[Gowtan yells]</b>

12:11.067 --> 12:12.487
<b>[all gasp]</b>

12:12.947 --> 12:14.027
<b>[chuckles smugly]</b>

12:14.157 --> 12:15.787
<b>[Gowtan grunts]</b>

12:15.907 --> 12:17.207
<b>[yells]</b>

12:17.327 --> 12:18.707
<b>[Mad Headder groans]</b>

12:18.827 --> 12:21.707
<b>[GOWTAN] Dragonslayer Split!</b>

12:22.497 --> 12:23.917
<b>[groaning]</b>

12:30.757 --> 12:32.637
<b>[crashes]</b>

12:32.757 --> 12:34.097
<b>[Gowtan panting]</b>

12:34.217 --> 12:36.137
<b>-Yeah!
-All right!</b>

12:36.257 --> 12:38.227
<b>-[all laughing]
-[chuckles softly]</b>

12:39.057 --> 12:40.387
<b>[cape rustling]</b>

12:49.607 --> 12:50.697
<b>[sighs]</b>

12:51.657 --> 12:52.777
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Level has increased</b>

12:52.907 --> 12:55.117
<b>from Level 16 to 23.</b>

12:55.237 --> 12:58.617
<b>[GOWTAN] Hmm.
A mere F-rank adventurer</b>

12:58.747 --> 13:01.247
<b>managed to survive
after going up</b>

13:01.367 --> 13:04.087
<b>against a monster
that nearly killed me?</b>

13:05.337 --> 13:09.467
<b>I just reached my limit.
So thank you, Gowtan.</b>

13:09.587 --> 13:10.797
<b>[growls]</b>

13:12.547 --> 13:14.427
<b>[all gasp]</b>

13:14.547 --> 13:16.217
<b>[♪ tense music playing]</b>

13:17.967 --> 13:19.427
<b>Hmm.</b>

13:19.977 --> 13:21.017
<b>[inhales deeply]</b>

13:21.847 --> 13:24.267
<b>-Forgive me, Elymas!
-[gasps]</b>

13:24.857 --> 13:27.937
<b>I'm sorry.
I've been an incompetent leader,</b>

13:28.277 --> 13:30.897
<b>and you were absolutely right
about everything.</b>

13:31.817 --> 13:32.817
<b>[ELYMAS] Gowtan?</b>

13:34.027 --> 13:36.577
<b>[GOWTAN]
I think you should take that.</b>

13:41.657 --> 13:43.827
<b>[ELYMAS] A Level 40 Magic Stone?</b>

13:44.417 --> 13:45.917
<b>Bet it's pretty valuable.</b>

13:46.287 --> 13:47.287
<b>I'm so broke,</b>

13:47.537 --> 13:49.547
<b>I'd be more than happy
to take it.</b>

13:50.797 --> 13:51.877
<b>You sure?</b>

13:52.257 --> 13:55.347
<b>Hmm. You're the adventurer
who destroyed that monster.</b>

13:55.467 --> 13:56.427
<b>Hmm?</b>

13:57.047 --> 13:59.217
<b>[gasps] Hmm.</b>

13:59.847 --> 14:02.137
<b>It seems that
along with the stone,</b>

14:02.267 --> 14:04.227
<b>this thing
dropped an item as well.</b>

14:05.397 --> 14:07.147
<b>Do you want to take that one?</b>

14:07.267 --> 14:08.187
<b>Huh?</b>

14:08.477 --> 14:11.397
<b>[grunts] Of course not.
You killed the beast,</b>

14:11.687 --> 14:14.397
<b>and I'm not someone
who goes back on his word.</b>

14:14.527 --> 14:15.527
<b>[groans]</b>

14:16.987 --> 14:18.077
<b>Uh...</b>

14:18.407 --> 14:21.367
<b>But could I just have a look
at the item description?</b>

14:21.497 --> 14:23.497
<b>-[all gasp]
-Yeah, sure.</b>

14:31.837 --> 14:33.757
<b>[all gasp in awe]</b>

14:33.877 --> 14:35.877
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Daemonsrage Shield.</b>

14:36.007 --> 14:37.757
<b>Plus 25 defense.</b>

14:37.887 --> 14:40.597
<b>Market price, 3 million gold.</b>

14:40.717 --> 14:42.177
<b>After blocking an attack,</b>

14:42.307 --> 14:45.807
<b>your next attack receives
a plus eight bonus.</b>

14:45.937 --> 14:46.857
<b>[all gasp]</b>

14:47.017 --> 14:48.147
<b>[ELYMAS] That thing
left a rare drop</b>

14:48.267 --> 14:49.567
<b>worth 3 million gold?!</b>

14:50.357 --> 14:52.147
<b>Rampart Reflection
only activates</b>

14:52.277 --> 14:53.607
<b>when my armor's struck.</b>

14:53.987 --> 14:55.527
<b>But with these kinds of stats,</b>

14:55.647 --> 14:57.317
<b>I could shut down attacks
around my level</b>

14:57.447 --> 14:58.527
<b>with just this shield!</b>

14:58.657 --> 15:01.617
<b>Although,
if I sold something valuable,</b>

15:01.737 --> 15:03.247
<b>it would attract a lot
of attention.</b>

15:03.367 --> 15:06.367
<b>This is really 3 million gold,
huh? [grunts]</b>

15:15.507 --> 15:16.757
<b>[ELYMAS] So, Gowtan...</b>

15:17.257 --> 15:18.927
<b>About my promotion.</b>

15:19.507 --> 15:21.177
<b>There's no need to worry.</b>

15:21.297 --> 15:23.597
<b>I'll tell the guild
it'll be their loss</b>

15:23.727 --> 15:26.477
<b>if they can't see your value
and move you up to rank E.</b>

15:26.597 --> 15:27.517
<b>[all gasp]</b>

15:28.137 --> 15:30.057
<b>And they'd better
do it right away.</b>

15:30.187 --> 15:31.687
<b>Do you really mean that?</b>

15:32.317 --> 15:33.897
<b>The guild said
I was to make sure</b>

15:34.027 --> 15:36.737
<b>you didn't do
anything deceitful and cheat.</b>

15:36.857 --> 15:38.407
<b>But their warning
was completely misguided.</b>

15:38.817 --> 15:39.817
<b>[gasps]</b>

15:40.447 --> 15:43.447
<b>So if anyone's foolish enough
to oppose your promotion,</b>

15:43.577 --> 15:44.787
<b>I'll knock them out!</b>

15:45.287 --> 15:48.787
<b>-Huh?
-[laughs boisterously]</b>

15:49.827 --> 15:51.787
<b>[all laugh awkwardly]</b>

15:51.917 --> 15:53.547
<b>Um. So, uh...</b>

15:54.257 --> 15:56.257
<b>-Excuse me, Mr. Gowtan.
-Huh?</b>

15:56.377 --> 15:58.927
<b>[TEAL] If it's all right,
I was wondering</b>

15:59.047 --> 16:01.297
<b>if you'd approve my promotion
as well.</b>

16:01.427 --> 16:02.807
<b>I mean, after all,</b>

16:02.927 --> 16:05.347
<b>it was my Heal that got you back
to your feet, wasn't it?</b>

16:05.467 --> 16:06.597
<b>-[GOWTAN] Teal!
-[gasps]</b>

16:06.727 --> 16:09.347
<b>You lost your nerve
while facing down that monster</b>

16:09.477 --> 16:11.307
<b>and let fear
get the better of you.</b>

16:11.437 --> 16:13.477
<b>I think we both know
I would never approve</b>

16:13.607 --> 16:14.607
<b>of such a thing.</b>

16:15.317 --> 16:18.187
<b>In dungeons, you'll encounter
far greater challenges</b>

16:18.317 --> 16:19.607
<b>than this one.</b>

16:19.737 --> 16:22.697
<b>You should go train
with some quests you can handle!</b>

16:24.697 --> 16:25.747
<b>[gasps]</b>

16:30.707 --> 16:32.417
<b>[whimpering]</b>

16:35.127 --> 16:36.257
<b>[sighs]</b>

16:36.547 --> 16:38.877
<b>♪</b>

17:01.317 --> 17:02.407
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

17:08.237 --> 17:10.037
<b>[distant chatter]</b>

17:28.387 --> 17:30.597
<b>And I let it slip
right through my fingers.</b>

17:30.727 --> 17:32.557
<b>Aw, look at the two lovebirds.</b>

17:34.437 --> 17:35.937
<b>[CRAFTSMAN] Not too bad, huh?</b>

17:36.067 --> 17:37.477
<b>[laughing]</b>

17:54.707 --> 17:56.667
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

17:57.167 --> 17:58.167
<b>[RECEPTIONIST] Um...</b>

17:58.797 --> 18:01.417
<b>I have your reward
for the raid here.</b>

18:02.127 --> 18:05.217
<b>First off,
you'll receive 130,000 gold.</b>

18:06.007 --> 18:07.177
<b>Huh?</b>

18:07.637 --> 18:10.177
<b>-[RECEPTIONIST] In addition...
-[both gasp]</b>

18:10.927 --> 18:13.057
<b>...you'll be receiving
200,000 gold</b>

18:13.177 --> 18:15.017
<b>for 10 Wight Magic Stones.</b>

18:15.687 --> 18:17.147
<b>[all gasp]</b>

18:17.267 --> 18:18.567
<b>[RECEPTIONIST]
And as for the final item...</b>

18:18.687 --> 18:19.607
<b>There's even more?</b>

18:20.277 --> 18:21.817
<b>...we've calculated
the grand total</b>

18:21.937 --> 18:24.447
<b>for the Mad Headder's
Magic Stone, and it's...</b>

18:24.567 --> 18:26.107
<b>[grunts]</b>

18:26.237 --> 18:27.577
<b>...600,000 gold.</b>

18:27.697 --> 18:29.617
<b>[all gasp]</b>

18:29.737 --> 18:31.077
<b>[laughs]</b>

18:31.197 --> 18:34.287
<b>Looks like you actually made
more money than I did this time.</b>

18:34.407 --> 18:36.287
<b>These raids are
pretty good money.</b>

18:37.037 --> 18:38.167
<b>[ADVENTURER 1]
That’s a ton of gold.</b>

18:38.417 --> 18:40.247
<b>[ADVENTURER 2] He made
even more than Mr. Gowtan?</b>

18:40.377 --> 18:41.917
<b>[curious chatter]</b>

18:43.627 --> 18:45.587
<b>Gowtan, sir. Um,</b>

18:45.717 --> 18:48.387
<b>did this man really go up
against the Ghoul Head variant</b>

18:48.507 --> 18:49.757
<b>and manage to take it down?</b>

18:49.887 --> 18:52.217
<b>Hold on.
Didn't he raise some eyebrows</b>

18:52.347 --> 18:55.057
<b>after bringing in high-level
Magic Stones before?</b>

18:55.557 --> 18:57.107
<b>He's got to be using a trick.</b>

18:57.227 --> 18:58.817
<b>What's his level anyway?</b>

18:58.937 --> 19:00.857
<b>[ADVENTURER 3] Defense classes
are too weak.</b>

19:01.527 --> 19:03.647
<b>[ADVENTURER 4] What do you have
to say about this, Mr. Gouton?</b>

19:03.777 --> 19:04.897
<b>[receptionist whimpers
nervously]</b>

19:05.067 --> 19:06.987
<b>[ADVENTURER 5] Yeah,
how could a defensive class</b>

19:07.117 --> 19:09.947
<b>like Heavy Knight
ever kill that many monsters?</b>

19:10.077 --> 19:11.327
<b>[Gowtan yells angrily]</b>

19:14.247 --> 19:17.287
<b>How dare you doubt
Elymas's abilities!</b>

19:17.417 --> 19:19.787
<b>I am the one
who approved his promotion,</b>

19:19.917 --> 19:21.997
<b>so you're all
insulting me as well!</b>

19:22.497 --> 19:24.547
<b>[all groan uneasily]</b>

19:25.507 --> 19:27.637
<b>[growling]</b>

19:31.967 --> 19:33.427
<b>[ELYMAS] Thanks for everything,
Gowtan.</b>

19:33.677 --> 19:35.767
<b>-I appreciate it.
-Hmm.</b>

19:36.517 --> 19:38.477
<b>Of course. Take care.</b>

19:38.597 --> 19:40.227
<b>[ELYMAS]
If he hadn't stood up for me,</b>

19:40.357 --> 19:42.607
<b>people would still be talking
behind my back.</b>

19:42.977 --> 19:45.067
<b>And with his help,
I was promoted</b>

19:45.187 --> 19:46.737
<b>from Rank F to Rank E.</b>

19:46.857 --> 19:48.197
<b>[BOY 1] Sure!</b>

19:49.777 --> 19:51.197
<b>[BOY 2] Like a real mission!</b>

19:51.327 --> 19:53.117
<b>[laughing]</b>

19:53.237 --> 19:55.287
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

19:55.407 --> 19:57.657
<b>Hey. You wanna team up?</b>

19:57.997 --> 19:59.827
<b>Nah. Thanks.</b>

20:00.917 --> 20:02.997
<b>[ELYMAS]
So, what should I do now?</b>

20:03.457 --> 20:05.207
<b>I've got to think this through.</b>

20:05.337 --> 20:07.917
<b>Since I finally
leveled up to Rank E,</b>

20:08.047 --> 20:10.587
<b>I can start entering dungeons
to farm gold.</b>

20:11.847 --> 20:13.927
<b>But the Rampart Reflection
strat relies</b>

20:14.057 --> 20:15.637
<b>on overwhelming defense.</b>

20:15.927 --> 20:17.347
<b>So for now, it only works</b>

20:17.477 --> 20:19.307
<b>when I'm up against
starter enemies.</b>

20:19.437 --> 20:21.687
<b>And with the skill setup
I'm working with,</b>

20:21.807 --> 20:24.437
<b>I'm pretty sure I'll be stuck
grinding levels for a while.</b>

20:24.977 --> 20:26.277
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

20:26.397 --> 20:29.107
<b>So for the moment,
to set my course,</b>

20:29.237 --> 20:31.027
<b>maybe I should try
looking for that.</b>

20:32.487 --> 20:34.037
<b>[gasps]</b>

20:35.287 --> 20:38.037
<b>A Fang of Smoldering Insanity
skill book.</b>

20:38.657 --> 20:40.747
<b>If I had one in my possession,</b>

20:40.877 --> 20:42.997
<b>I'd be able to unlock
an entire skill tree.</b>

20:43.587 --> 20:47.087
<b>They're extremely rare,
so I won't find one right away.</b>

20:47.707 --> 20:49.377
<b>But looking for one is free.</b>

20:51.007 --> 20:51.967
<b>REMAINING SKILL POINTS: 5
OATH OF THE HEAVY ARMOR</b>

20:52.087 --> 20:53.297
<b>Oath of the Heavy Armor</b>

20:53.967 --> 20:56.057
<b>and Fang of Smoldering Insanity.</b>

20:56.517 --> 20:58.467
<b>These are two skill trees
that work together</b>

20:58.597 --> 21:00.267
<b>to complete the Heavy Knight.</b>

21:01.557 --> 21:02.977
<b>And when that happens,</b>

21:03.057 --> 21:05.567
<b>the Heavy Knight is no longer
a defense specialist,</b>

21:05.687 --> 21:07.817
<b>but referring to it
as an offense specialist</b>

21:07.937 --> 21:09.027
<b>isn't right either.</b>

21:09.607 --> 21:12.987
<b>At that point,
it becomes a human weapon.</b>

21:14.657 --> 21:16.077
<b>If I want to move forward</b>

21:16.197 --> 21:17.697
<b>and unlock my true potential,</b>

21:18.367 --> 21:20.787
<b>Fang of Smoldering Insanity
is vital.</b>

21:20.997 --> 21:22.077
<b>But...</b>

21:22.917 --> 21:25.337
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

21:39.887 --> 21:42.977
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>

23:10.517 --> 23:12.227
<b>[ELYMAS] Though the battle
was hard-won,</b>

23:12.357 --> 23:15.027
<b>I still managed to get promoted
to Rank E.</b>

23:15.147 --> 23:17.817
<b>For me, the next step
couldn't be clearer.</b>

23:17.947 --> 23:19.777
<b>I'll become a real Heavy Knight.</b>

23:21.487 --> 23:23.947
<b>Not one known
as a defense specialist,</b>

23:24.077 --> 23:25.957
<b>nor one who focuses on offense,</b>

23:26.077 --> 23:29.287
<b>but as a warrior who fights
like a human weapon.</b>

23:29.417 --> 23:32.497
<b>And to do that,
I have to find that skill book.</b>

23:32.797 --> 23:33.797
<b>Next time,</b>

23:33.917 --> 23:35.917
<b>"Fang of Smoldering Insanity."</b>

23:36.047 --> 23:39.387
<b>Anyway, this problem
is shockingly expensive.</b>
